This site follows the development of **WHAM! BAM! HAM-HAM!**, the Card Brawler from WHAM! BAM! Studios. The DevLog collects concise updates about the work in progress, experiments, and decisions behind the game.

[Browse every DevLog entry]($link.page('devlog')) or [subscribe via RSS]($link.page('devlog').alternative('rss')). New to the game? Start with the [WHAM! BAM! HAM-HAM! Player Guide]($link.page('guides')).